OL,3,GNEWSANext data accessed in cyber breach
OL,4,
OL,5,FNext has said that some of its data has
OL,6,Fbeen accessed in a cyber breach
OL,7,Faffecting a third-party online
OL,8,Fsupplier.
OL,10,FThe high street retailer said there was
OL,11,Fno evidence that customers' personal
OL,12,Fdata had been compromised.
OL,14,FThe firm, which has its headquarters in
OL,15,FEnderby, Leicestershire, said it had
OL,16,Fbeen informed by one of its suppliers
OL,17,Fabout the incident, which led to
OL,18,F"unauthorised access to certain benign
OL,19,Fdata relating to Next".
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
